  "review": "<div class=\"my-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-900 via-indigo-900 to-slate-900 text-white shadow-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n  <div class=\"space-y-0.5 text-center sm:text-left\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-1.5 text-amber-300 font-extrabold text-xs\">\n      <span>❄️</span><span>2026年 冬〜年末年始旅行の予約速報</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-200\">\n      冬の味覚解禁（カニ・ふぐ・寒ブリ）や雪見露天・年末年始の宿泊枠は例年10月中旬〜11月上旬で満室が急増します。空室状況はお早めに確認を。\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F13482%2F13482.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-stone-950 font-black text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition transform hover:scale-105\">\n    🏨 花巻温泉郷おすすめ宿セレクションのリアルタイム空室＆極上カニ料理＆宿泊プラン →\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】花巻温泉郷おすすめ宿5選！岩手の地酒（南部杜氏）と郷土料理を味わい尽くす名旅館比較</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-emerald-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-emerald-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🍶 南部杜氏の郷・岩手で「温泉×地酒ペアリング」を楽しむコツ</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">日本三大杜氏筆頭「南部杜氏」の故郷である岩手県花巻。清冽な名水と酒米で醸された地酒（赤武、南部美人、あさ開、月の輪など）と、岩手の至宝「前沢牛」「花巻温泉郷おすすめ宿セレクション」「花巻温泉郷おすすめ宿セレクション」を極上温泉とともに味わうのが旅の醍醐味です。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 花巻温泉郷で後悔しない厳選5選</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">花巻温泉　佳松園</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.75</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/13482/13482.jpg\" alt=\"花巻温泉　佳松園 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 南部赤松林に囲まれた至高の数寄屋造り！pH9.0のとろとろ美肌湯と極上会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">皇族も宿泊された花巻温泉の最高峰旅館。中庭の日本庭園を望む檜露天風呂は、美容液のようなpH9.0のアルカリ性単純温泉。夕食は前沢牛や三陸の旬魚を南部杜氏の厳選酒とともに個室食事処で堪能できます。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>記念日、ご夫婦、美食家、本物の静寂とおもてなしを求める人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>岩手最高峰の空間美と極上会席料理に心酔するなら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F13482%2F13482.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】花巻温泉　佳松園 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">花巻温泉郷　新鉛温泉　結びの宿　愛隣館</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.27</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/9546/9546.jpg\" alt=\"花巻温泉郷　新鉛温泉　結びの宿　愛隣館 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 3つの豊富な源泉と17の湯船！豊沢川の渓流露天風呂とバイキング</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">新鉛温泉の大自然に包まれた名宿。川沿いの深さ1mの立ち湯露天風呂や岩風呂など、多彩な湯巡りが自慢。岩手の郷土料理やかまど料理、地酒バーが揃い、宿泊満足度抜群です。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>三世代ファミリー、温泉マニア、カップル、多彩なお風呂を楽しみたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>大自然の絶景露天風呂と郷土味覚を遊び尽くすならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F9546%2F9546.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】花巻温泉郷　新鉛温泉　結びの宿　愛隣館 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div clas